@startuml
title Происхождение трасс W3C для одного обмена через прокси
autonumber

actor "Клиент" as Client
participant "SERVER span Vigilant" as Server
participant "INTERNAL span\nvigilant.request.inspect" as RequestInspect
participant "CLIENT span\nvigilant.identity.external.lookup" as IdentityLookup
participant "Trusted identity Bridge" as Bridge
participant "HTTP CLIENT span\nвышестоящего запроса" as UpstreamSpan
participant "Вышестоящий сервер OpenAI" as Upstream
participant "INTERNAL span\nvigilant.response.inspect" as ResponseInspect

Client -> Server : запрос с необязательными traceparent, tracestate и сеансом
activate Server
Server -> RequestInspect : создать непосредственный дочерний span
activate RequestInspect
opt External identity mode
  RequestInspect -> IdentityLookup : создать дочерний CLIENT span
  activate IdentityLookup
  IdentityLookup -> Bridge : exact one-attempt POST
  Bridge --> IdentityLookup : complete response / failure
  IdentityLookup --> RequestInspect : finite outcome
  deactivate IdentityLookup
end
RequestInspect -> RequestInspect : parse/context/select
RequestInspect -> RequestInspect : stdout analysis_started,\ndetector execution, stdout analysis_completed
RequestInspect --> Server : теневое решение
deactivate RequestInspect
Server -> UpstreamSpan : создать непосредственный дочерний span
activate UpstreamSpan
UpstreamSpan -> Upstream : запрос с итоговым контекстом трассы
Upstream --> UpstreamSpan : response удерживается до terminal state
UpstreamSpan --> Server : gateway-owned complete response
deactivate UpstreamSpan
Server -> ResponseInspect : создать непосредственный дочерний span
activate ResponseInspect
ResponseInspect -> ResponseInspect : ordinary/SSE protocol parse
ResponseInspect -> ResponseInspect : stdout analysis_started,\ndetectors/reaction, stdout analysis_completed
ResponseInspect --> Server : exact forward / masked forward / safe reject
deactivate ResponseInspect
Server --> Client : ответ с итоговым сеансом и SERVER traceparent
deactivate Server
@enduml
